// M5Stack Core2 / ESP32 Renode platform sketch.
//
// This is a contract sketch, not a bootable platform yet. The long-term GAR
// direction is to grow this into an AI-maintained virtual board. See
// ROADMAP.md in this directory for milestones and non-goals.

// Desired hardware surface:
// - ESP32 / Xtensa LX6 CPUs
// - internal RAM and boot ROM mapping
// - SPI flash mapping with bootloader, partition table, boot_app0, app
// - UART0 analyzer
// - GPIO buttons A/B/C
// - SPI LCD compatible with the M5Stack display path
// - Wi-Fi/network model or a Product-supplied protocol bridge
